  "decision_conditions": [
    "Insufficient information, by reason of a lack of a parking stress survey, has been submitted to demonstrate the proposal would not result in unacceptable demand for on-street carparking within the local road network and impacts on the highway function and safety, contrary to Policy T4 of the London Plan (2021) and, Policies DM9 and DM10 of the Kingston Core Strategy (2012).",
    "Insufficient information, in the form of robust and rigorous marketing evidence, has been submitted to demonstrate there is no quantitative or qualitative demand for the use of site for employment purposes, contrary to Policies CS12 and DM17 of the Kingston Core Strategy (2012), and Policy E2 of the London Plan (2021).",
    "Insufficient information, due to the lack of a Noise Impact Assessment, has been submitted to determine whether mitigation measures are required to ensure neighbouring occupants would not be exposed to an unacceptable level of noise resulting from the proposed use, contrary to Policies D13 and D14 of the London Plan (2021) and Policy DM10 of the Kingston Core Strategy (2012)."
  ],
